     free are structures.  The function handle NULL argument.

     The function ffiilleeaarrggss__llssttaatt() is equivalent to lstat(2).

     The functions ffiilleeaarrggss__ooppeenn() and ffiilleeaarrggss__ffooppeenn() are respectively
